# Claude Code. The skill pack, the hooks and the shared settings are project configuration
# and are version-controlled (E24); everything else under .claude/ is per-machine session
# state (settings.local.json, worktrees, caches, locks) and must never be committed.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
.DS_Store
/rust/target/
